he club will be forced to close the following year due to a lack of membership.\n\nMeanwhile, with impending graduation, it is also time for the seniors to decide their plans for the future. Unlike their friend Rin Matsuoka, the new captain of Samezuka Academy Swim Club who is determined to fulfill his dream of being a professional swimmer, Haruka and Makoto are unsure about what career path they want to take.\n\nFurther problems arise when an old friend of Rin's, Sousuke Yamazaki, comes to the city to study at Samezuka Academy; the recently scouted swimmer's arrival causes tension in the relationship among him, Rin, and Haruka.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Swimming","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School Club","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":81,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cute Boys Doing Cute Things","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rehabilitation","rank":65,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Foreign","rank":60,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Free! -Eternal Summer-","english":"Free! -Eternal Summer-","native":"Free!-Eternal Summer-","romaji":"Free!: Eternal Summer","synonyms":[{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"水泳部！永恒的夏日"}]},"trailer":{"id":"zIFT4L-tGRI","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zIFT4L-tGRI/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}